"The test case has no answer for this step ({what}). Save it again from a run that gets this far.":"a-uš-šu-wa-ar A-NA GÌR ka-a-ša EGIR-pa me-ma-at-tar UL ḫar-zi ({what}). IŠ-TU i-ya-u-wa-ar ku-iš ka-a a-ri EGIR-pa ḫar-ak.",
